	dprr:hasNoteText "Served under Catulus in northern Italy against the Cimbri, fled from Tridentum, and committed suicide when his father forbade him to enter his presence (Val. Max. 5.8.4; Frontin. Str. 4.1.13; Auct. Vir. Ill. 72.10)." .
